{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1064260-first-time-playing-mage","id":1064260,"title":"First time playing mage","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-03-18T05:07:57-07:00","id":1064260,"title":"First time playing mage","content":"so I'm going to be playing mage soon. I know the core structure of WoD rules and how Mage works generally but I've got some questions: I'm planning on playing a Thyrsus. Now a lot of what I'll be doing involves insects so I know I'll be going into Life but part of my goal, yes I'm being serious, to make giant sentient bees. I want to see what happens. I don't know why, I just want to. The ST is supportive and I wanted to know if there are any good Legacies for this. I almost specifically want to make the bees permanently huge and sentient as well as not poof out of existence due to paradox (note I said I generally understand how mage works, I don't know exactly how paradox works. got told it could mutate them as well which is fine).<br /> Another thing I was thinking was if I wanted to kill someone by sending bees through the internet with a combination of spells how would I do it? <br /> Can I make a gun that shoots swarms of bees? <br /> With Life is it possible to convert a human's sweat glands into Bee's Wax producing glands?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>pls respont","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/372-cerealkiller","name":"cerealkiller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar372_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-18T06:51:09-07:00","id":1064275,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>cerealkiller</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1064260-first-time-playing-mage#post1064260\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Can I make a gun that shoots swarms of bees?<br /> With Life is it possible to convert a human's sweat glands into Bee's Wax producing glands?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes. (<span style=\"font-size:8px\">characters)</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-18T06:59:33-07:00","id":1064279,"title":"","content":"First welcome. <br /> <br /> Don't know of a Legacy off the top of my head.<br /> <br /> How big do you want the bees to be? Twice the size of normal or ride upon their back sized. Riding bees may be paradoxal in and of themselves. <br /> <br /> With Matter you could probably use Wonderful Machine and combine a bee hive with a shotgun and fire them that way. It normally combines two machines but a generous ST may allow it.<br /> <br /> Life 3 transmute life to give a human the ability to produce bee wax from a gland.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-18T07:11:22-07:00","id":1064282,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hardwire99</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1064260-first-time-playing-mage?p=1064279#post1064279\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">First welcome.<br /> <br /> Don't know of a Legacy off the top of my head.<br /> <br /> How big do you want the bees to be? Twice the size of normal or ride upon their back sized. Riding bees may be paradoxal in and of themselves.<br /> <br /> With Matter you could probably use Wonderful Machine and combine a bee hive with a shotgun and fire them that way. It normally combines two machines but a generous ST may allow it.<br /> <br /> Life 3 transmute life to give a human the ability to produce bee wax from a gland.</div> </div> </div> </div>What about using spirit and matter to embed a spirit in a gun to make it shoot bees? I want them to be the size of a medium sized dog (about 40lbs, 18kg)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>pls respont","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/372-cerealkiller","name":"cerealkiller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar372_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-18T07:12:50-07:00","id":1064283,"title":"","content":"Transform life has a neat reach effect that allows for passing features to descendants. So it seems easy to make a line of bigger and bigger bees.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1090276-2e-moinen-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">[2E] Moinen's Homebrew Hub</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1747-moinen","name":"Moinen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1747_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"889"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-18T07:24:44-07:00","id":1064287,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>cerealkiller</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1064260-first-time-playing-mage?p=1064282#post1064282\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What about using spirit and matter to embed a spirit in a gun to make it shoot bees? I want them to be the size of a medium sized dog (about 40lbs, 18kg)</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Wont do unless the spirit is veeery powerful.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1090276-2e-moinen-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">[2E] Moinen's Homebrew Hub</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1747-moinen","name":"Moinen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1747_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"889"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-18T07:27:12-07:00","id":1064288,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Moinen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1064260-first-time-playing-mage?p=1064287#post1064287\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Wont do unless the spirit is veeery powerful.</div> </div> </div> </div>well the bees coming out of the gun won't be that size, I just want to put a bee spirit in a gun and use it to summon swarms of bees.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>pls respont","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/372-cerealkiller","name":"cerealkiller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar372_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-18T07:49:37-07:00","id":1064297,"title":"","content":"Bees that size would either have to be magical in nature or have continuous spells cast on them (Life or Forces should do it) in order to actually fly and possibly to even survive at that size. Transform Life could very well create such a bee, but it would not help it overcome the laws of physics.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-18T08:09:26-07:00","id":1064304,"title":"","content":"Good Legacies, I'm not sure of, especially since that is fairly narrow and specific, but hey, there's no reason your character can't form their own! Tamers of Honey, anyone?<br /> <br /> As for a gun that fires bees, Wonderful Machine explicitly has the ability to graft abilities onto living things, or vice versa, with Life 3. Doesn't seem like a stretch at all to make a bee-shotgun with that.<br /> <br /> Sweat glands into beeswax-producing glands seems like nothing more than Transform Life (Life 3).<br /> <br /> Giant bees. Well, that sounds like (essentially) a new species all together, so Create Life, which is Life 5, with Mind 5 if you want to make them sapient. That size isn't too unreasonable in regards to flight (word of warning: not a biologist or physicist); a quick online search shows that there are the kori bustard which are about 16kg, so flight should be doable; maybe mix in Forces 4 to help them out on the flight problem. The only way (that I can think of) to make them not subject to Paradox would be via a Legacy Attainment, so more evidence for a custom Legacy.<br /> <br /> Now Bees!.exe hmmm... Well, I guess that could be as simple as a Making spell at sympathetic range (the sympathy forged by whatever online interaction you have with the target), so Life 5 with Space 2. Though if the bees are just the vector for damage and then just sublimate away, that is Life 3 or 4 at sympathetic range with Space 2. If you wanted a literal download that when opened, summoned a bunch of bees, that sounds like one of the aforementioned spells hung with Hung Spell (so Time 2) that has a conditional duration (so Fate 2) set to expire when the file opens. Maybe with Forces 2 in order to transfer the &quot;file&quot; as Forces seems to have what little computer-y stuff there is. Honestly, Forces 2 might replace Space 2 as the vector of transmission at this point.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1897-ffanxii4ever","name":"ffanxii4ever","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1897_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"109"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-18T08:17:32-07:00","id":1064306,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>cerealkiller</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1064260-first-time-playing-mage#post1064260\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Another thing I was thinking was if I wanted to kill someone by sending bees through the internet with a combination of spells how would I do it?</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bThe right levels of Space/Life should do this in various ways with the internet just being flavor text. The right levels of Forces/Life with Time for a triggered delay could transform energy stored in an email attachment to bees when the email is opened (I would think)<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3385-ckobbe","name":"ckobbe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"151"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-18T09:10:51-07:00","id":1064329,"title":"","content":"Do you have some way of controlling the bee's too? Just firing em out a gun at somebody wont really make them sting that person? Wont firing them out a gun probably kill them? If they are just coming out of said gun then they will be closer to you at the end of your gun that an opponent far away?<br /> <br /> You'll need at least Life 2 &quot;Control Instincts&quot; to control bee's to attack people id say. Huge bee's wont poof out of existence via paradox but by dissonance so having some legacy attainment that creates huge bee's may solve that.<br /> <br /> Even a spirit with Influence: Bee's 5 can only mass create a number of bee's equal to its rank?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1534,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1534-totalgit","user":"totalgit","date":". 03-18-2017, 12:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1534-totalgit","name":"totalgit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1534_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"742"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-18T09:55:15-07:00","id":1064347,"title":"","content":"I can see it now a Tommy Gun that has a Bee Hive as its Drum, The barrel is enchanted to encapsulate the bee in a forcefield, The forcefield dissipates after doing regular bullet damage and the bee, now free and angry, attacks. However this bee has been breed to deliver the Dreaded Australian Funnel-web Spiders venom. This venom has the Lure spell suspended by a hung spell produced by the gun. It attracts other bees of every type, especially the massive Rage drones controlled by the Tamer of Honey.<br /> <br /> <br /> Now I want me one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12802,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","user":"Hardwire99","date":". 03-18-2017, 12:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-18T10:09:15-07:00","id":1064352,"title":"","content":"Someone better then i would need to actually build this Artifact. I could I just don't think I could do it justice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-18T10:09:29-07:00","id":1064353,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1064260-first-time-playing-mage?p=1064297#post1064297\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Bees that size would either have to be magical in nature or have continuous spells cast on them (Life or Forces should do it) in order to actually fly and possibly to even survive at that size. Transform Life could very well create such a bee, but it would not help it overcome the laws of physics.</div> </div> </div> </div>I couldn't just &quot;augment life&quot; or something to take regular bees and make them into giant bees?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ffanxii4ever</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1064260-first-time-playing-mage?p=1064304#post1064304\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Good Legacies, I'm not sure of, especially since that is fairly narrow and specific, but hey, there's no reason your character can't form their own! Tamers of Honey, anyone?</div> </div> </div> </div>yeah the ST suggested I make my own legacy. I don't know mage that well, I was more of a prommie, vamp and hunter player.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ffanxii4ever</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1064260-first-time-playing-mage?p=1064304#post1064304\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As for a gun that fires bees, Wonderful Machine explicitly has the ability to graft abilities onto living things, or vice versa, with Life 3. Doesn't seem like a stretch at all to make a bee-shotgun with that.</div> </div> </div> </div> perfect. how deep into matter would I need to go for a bee hive shooting gun? I'm kind of imagining an old vietnam era style grenade launcher but instead of a grenade its a beehive that bursts and now there are bees everywhere.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ffanxii4ever</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1064260-first-time-playing-mage?p=1064304#post1064304\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sweat glands into beeswax-producing glands seems like nothing more than Transform Life (Life 3).</div> </div> </div> </div> I figured this was a relatively straight forward one. I'm thinking of using this offensively to cause folks to not be able to sweat which will over heat them. then my giant bees can come forth and build a glorious colony.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ffanxii4ever</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1064260-first-time-playing-mage?p=1064304#post1064304\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Giant bees. Well, that sounds like (essentially) a new species all together, so Create Life, which is Life 5, with Mind 5 if you want to make them sapient. That size isn't too unreasonable in regards to flight (word of warning: not a biologist or physicist); a quick online search shows that there are the kori bustard which are about 16kg, so flight should be doable; maybe mix in Forces 4 to help them out on the flight problem. The only way (that I can think of) to make them not subject to Paradox would be via a Legacy Attainment, so more evidence for a custom Legacy.</div> </div> </div> </div> I figured that there would be some kind of enlarge or enhance life spell to transform bees into giant bees. The idea of a homemade legacy is sounding better and better.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ffanxii4ever</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1064260-first-time-playing-mage?p=1064304#post1064304\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Now Bees!.exe hmmm... Well, I guess that could be as simple as a Making spell at sympathetic range (the sympathy forged by whatever online interaction you have with the target), so Life 5 with Space 2. Though if the bees are just the vector for damage and then just sublimate away, that is Life 3 or 4 at sympathetic range with Space 2. If you wanted a literal download that when opened, summoned a bunch of bees, that sounds like one of the aforementioned spells hung with Hung Spell (so Time 2) that has a conditional duration (so Fate 2) set to expire when the file opens. Maybe with Forces 2 in order to transfer the &quot;file&quot; as Forces seems to have what little computer-y stuff there is. Honestly, Forces 2 might replace Space 2 as the vector of transmission at this point.</div> </div> </div> </div>yeah the ST said this was some unholy spell combination. I was thinking a link or email attachment type thing. they open it and bees pour out of the monitor.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>pls respont","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/372-cerealkiller","name":"cerealkiller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar372_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-18T10:24:08-07:00","id":1064361,"title":"","content":"This is giving me flashbacks to an old game that ended up involving Ascended bees.<br /> <br /> Shine on, you beautiful fucking diamond, you.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2855-axelgear","name":"Axelgear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2855_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1450"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-18T10:29:26-07:00","id":1064364,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Axelgear</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1064260-first-time-playing-mage?p=1064361#post1064361\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This is giving me flashbacks to an old game that ended up involving Ascended bees.<br /> <br /> Shine on, you beautiful fucking diamond, you.</div> </div> </div> </div>what I really want to do is make the bees sentient, then study them having existential crisis of purpose. I'm not sure why. I just think it would be fun. If I can make a bee awaken it'll bee even better.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>pls respont","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/372-cerealkiller","name":"cerealkiller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar372_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-18T10:32:20-07:00","id":1064367,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>cerealkiller</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1064260-first-time-playing-mage?p=1064353#post1064353\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I couldn't just &quot;augment life&quot; or something to take regular bees and make them into giant bees?</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, changing the size of a creature should simply be a Life 3 spell, but doing that would kill the bee due to simple biology/geometry/physics. You could increase the weight by a factor of eight but that would only increase the area of the wings and the area of the cross section of limbs by four. The thickness of the exoskeleton would only double and be incredibly fragile in comparison to the new size. This is what limits the size of life on our planet. An insect has a hard upper limit for how big it can be. I think 18 kg exceeds that limit, but even if it doesn't you'd have to redesign the entire bee just so it can survive. And then there would still be no fucking way it could fly.<br /> <br /> Now, it should be completely possible to create a magic bee that size that shits all over the laws of physics, but the Transform Life option of creating a Lasting species (via the +2 Reach option) (which was what I tried to reply to) of such bees is completely out the window. Such a bee must have a continuous magical effect keeping it going.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-18T10:32:50-07:00","id":1064369,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>cerealkiller</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1064260-first-time-playing-mage?p=1064364#post1064364\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">what I really want to do is make the bees sentient, then study them having existential crisis of purpose. I'm not sure why. I just think it would be fun. If I can make a bee awaken it'll bee even better.</div> </div> </div> </div>Mind 5 Psychic Genesis.<br /> <br /> By the way for bigass flying insects check out Japanese hornets. They're ridiculous.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-18T10:45:34-07:00","id":1064376,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mrmdubois</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1064260-first-time-playing-mage?p=1064369#post1064369\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Mind 5 Psychic Genesis.<br /> <br /> By the way for bigass flying insects check out Japanese hornets. They're ridiculous.</div> </div> </div> </div>I mostly want to do bees so I can do this under the guise of &quot;saving the environment&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>pls respont","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/372-cerealkiller","name":"cerealkiller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar372_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-18T10:55:08-07:00","id":1064381,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted